lg:DE-BDSG-s38-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "0b1f8a42a22bfb280b8f5827f0460a02ec8517e435f6f553be87b0b8f16f10a5" ;
    lgo:text "(1) In addition to points (b) and (c) of Article 37(1) of Regulation (EU) 2016/679, the controller and the processor shall designate a data protection officer if, as a rule, they constantly employ at least 20 persons in the automated processing of personal data. If the controller or the processor carries out processing that is subject to a data protection impact assessment under Article 35 of Regulation (EU) 2016/679, or processes personal data commercially for the purpose of transfer, anonymised transfer or market or opinion research, they shall designate a data protection officer regardless of the number of persons employed in the processing."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-BDSG-s38-1-q1 .

