lg:DE-EinwV-s19-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "b3540c5a6e3ae22aa493ec85c5ebd1175496e470205d9a990f3b1fce0498db61" ;
    lgo:text "(1) Providers of digital services that integrate a recognised consent-management service must respect the settings of the end users. Providers who have not obtained consent from an end user through the integrated recognised consent-management service and the end user's settings must, when prompting that end user for consent, at the same time point out the end user's settings held by the recognised consent-management service."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-EinwV-s19-1-q1 .

lg:DE-EinwV-s3-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "4d529684bfd62a0f72b5e53db8d7320ef1d699ad4951d2f802c09df66e3c49af" ;
    lgo:text """(2) The recognised consent-management service may manage only those consents for which the provider of digital services has informed the end user, before consent is given, at least of
1. the provider or providers of digital services or the third parties that store information on the end user's terminal equipment or can access information already stored on it,
2. the specific information that is to be stored on the end user's terminal equipment and the information already stored there that is to be accessed,
3. the purposes for which information is to be stored on the end user's terminal equipment and for which information already stored there is to be accessed,
4. the periods for which information is to be stored on the end user's terminal equipment and during which information already stored there is to be accessed,
5. the revocability of the consent at any time, and that the lawfulness of the accesses and storages carried out on the basis of the consent within the meaning of § 25(1) of the Telekommunikation-Digitale-Dienste-Datenschutz-Gesetz before the revocation is not affected by the revocation.
Further information duties of providers of digital services remain unaffected."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-EinwV-s3-2-q1 .

lg:DE-EinwV-s4-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "5f12f7b8d61427c830c2490bb4746242266ce4eef8627ec1af6ddd8f2061b9c6" ;
    lgo:text """(1) A consent-management procedure is user-friendly if
1. the consent-management service's user interface is designed so transparently and comprehensibly that the end user can make a free and informed decision, and
2. the end user's settings, including the date and time at which the settings were made, together with the information provided at that time, can be viewed by the end user at any time and the end user's settings can be changed and, where applicable, withdrawn by the end user at any time."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-EinwV-s4-1-q1 .

lg:DE-EinwV-s4-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "1c8b9e08f763ac5f2e0c9ca2d7ffefe9b927af9639d98bcf4ece5f96a23a693f" ;
    lgo:text "(2) A request by the recognised consent-management service to review the end user's settings may be made no earlier than after one year, unless the end user has provided for a different setting."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-EinwV-s4-2-q1 .

lg:DE-EinwV-title-53d210b15674-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "53d210b1567478ee08126dff7e8c6e63a962e0cf5fcc8ab7e7ea6516b6aca580" ;
    lgo:text "Ordinance on consent-management services under the Telekommunikation-Digitale-Dienste-Datenschutz-Gesetz"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "SWE-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-EinwV .

lg:DE-ElektroG-s18-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "19c1934bce4294a9d7d204541748bdf57df0a038fcaf015fd6337c786e81ff74" ;
    lgo:text """(3) Distributors obliged to take back old devices under § 17(1) sentence 1 or (1a) shall, from the time they offer electrical or electronic equipment, inform private households by means of clearly visible and legible written or pictorial signs placed directly in view of the flow of customers about the following:
1. the obligation of end users under § 10(1) sentence 1,
2. the obligation of end users to remove old batteries under § 10(1) sentence 2 and the risks of handling lithium batteries,
3. the obligation to remove lamps under § 10(1) sentence 2,
4. the obligation of distributors to take back old devices free of charge under § 17(1) and (2),
5. the options they have created for returning old devices,
6. the end users' own responsibility for deleting personal data on the old devices to be disposed of, and
7. the meaning of the symbol in Annex 3.
Distributors who offer electrical or electronic equipment using means of distance communication shall, from the time they offer it, publish the information under sentence 1 for private households in a clearly visible and easy-to-find manner in the media of presentation they use, or enclose it in writing with the delivery of the goods."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-ElektroG-s18-3-q1 .

lg:DE-ElektroG-s6-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "482b20a2a4ac3e4f787950d6679262db75e51a73a7e838af2fdee80295ad0cd0" ;
    lgo:text "(3) Every producer is obliged to state its registration number when offering equipment and on invoices."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-ElektroG-s6-3-q1 .

