lg:DE-TDDDG-s1-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "5558b243240b7642adaefe5f8cd6cc08ced23c51e40c3898b5dd6b2c165c17e9" ;
    lgo:text "(3) This Act applies to all undertakings and persons that have an establishment within the territorial scope of this Act, or provide services or take part in providing them, or make goods available on the market there. § 3 of the Digital Services Act (DDG) remains unaffected."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-TDDDG-s1-3-q1 .

lg:DE-TDDDG-s25-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "6c7611d846311026d95816464a63d25154195305eb8b9c63b02ce0bbbe4548e3" ;
    lgo:text "(1) Storing information in the end user's terminal equipment, or accessing information already stored in the terminal equipment, is permitted only if the end user has consented on the basis of clear and comprehensive information. The information of the end user and the consent shall be given in accordance with Regulation (EU) 2016/679."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-TDDDG-s25-1-q1 .

lg:DE-TDDDG-s25-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "6ecdb5f51db1ae3e89aa918e662695a56e39e8107a1161a0cc8b1c77ffb1c0c8" ;
    lgo:text """(2) Consent under paragraph 1 is not required
1. if the sole purpose of storing information in the end user's terminal equipment, or the sole purpose of accessing information already stored in the end user's terminal equipment, is to carry out the transmission of a message over a public telecommunications network, or
2. if storing information in the end user's terminal equipment, or accessing information already stored in the end user's terminal equipment, is strictly necessary for the provider of a digital service to be able to provide a digital service expressly requested by the user."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-TDDDG-s25-2-q1 .

lg:DE-TDDDG-s26-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "83dd5d5ccc8015a8acfb922c6e22144159493fe2e3948c078a7c41da0ecef3bc" ;
    lgo:text """(1) Services for managing consents given under § 25(1) that
1. have user-friendly and competition-compliant procedures and technical applications for obtaining and managing consent,
2. have no economic self-interest in the giving of consent or in the data managed, and are independent of undertakings that may have such an interest,
3. process the personal data and the information on consent decisions for no purposes other than consent management, and
4. submit a security concept that allows the quality and reliability of the service and the technical applications to be assessed and shows that the service meets, both technically and organisationally, the legal requirements for data protection and data security arising in particular from Regulation (EU) 2016/679,
may be recognised by an independent body in accordance with the statutory instrument under subsection 2."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-TDDDG-s26-1-q1 .

lg:DE-TDDDG-s28-1-13-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "e77a1fdc02303881aa6c8aa02fad4197ad2a6d3042bc0c67dd4f626a72c1032f" ;
    lgo:text "stores information or accesses information contrary to § 25(1) sentence 1."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-TDDDG-s28-1-13-q1 .

lg:DE-TDDDG-s28-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "65c58480b99053c98683449d2c0144cc0be0a4a1eec179cf1305c13d4c1da483" ;
    lgo:text "(2) The administrative offence may be punished, in the cases of subsection 1 numbers 2, 3, 9, 11, 12 and 13, with a fine of up to three hundred thousand euros; in the cases of subsection 1 numbers 4 and 5, with a fine of up to one hundred thousand euros; in the cases of subsection 1 number 8, with a fine of up to fifty thousand euros; and in the other cases with a fine of up to ten thousand euros."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-04"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-TDDDG-s28-2-q1 .

