lg:DE-VSBG-s36-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "cbf542f0b3b2d9997a477221ad5453dc3673d63cbbed4e3c89ee16d19a20874c" ;
    lgo:text """(1) A trader who maintains a website or uses general terms and conditions shall, in an easily accessible, clear and comprehensible manner,
1. inform the consumer to what extent the trader is willing or obliged to take part in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer conciliation body, and
2. refer to the competent consumer conciliation body if the trader has undertaken to take part in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer conciliation body or is obliged by law to take part; the reference must include the address and website of the consumer conciliation body and a declaration by the trader that it will take part in dispute resolution proceedings before that consumer conciliation body."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-10-31"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-VSBG-s36-1-q1 .

lg:DE-VSBG-s36-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "e14e6e7455a82a15734292d0d44458ba68d4bc34e9bb1db926b350b31779eeea" ;
    lgo:text """(2) The information under subsection (1) must
1. appear on the trader's website, if the trader maintains a website,
2. be given together with its general terms and conditions, if the trader uses general terms and conditions."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-10-31"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-VSBG-s36-2-q1 .

lg:DE-VSBG-s36-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "d1207d2c0d52b81b0c951d5277bf8af22ed16b90c76e19236d54ee0e5eb7418e" ;
    lgo:text "(3) A trader who employed ten or fewer persons on 31 December of the previous year is exempt from the information duty under subsection (1) number 1."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-10-31"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-VSBG-s36-3-q1 .

lg:DE-VSBG-s37-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "d8123b021fa26d4501eb3f31983e81be0aaf81810e582510240a7a9b67b80306" ;
    lgo:text "(1) The trader shall refer the consumer to a consumer conciliation body competent for it, stating its address and website, if a dispute about a consumer contract could not be settled between the trader and the consumer. The trader shall at the same time state whether it is willing or obliged to take part in dispute resolution proceedings before that consumer conciliation body. If the trader is willing or obliged to take part in the dispute resolution proceedings of one or more consumer conciliation bodies, it shall name that body or those bodies."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-10-31"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:DE-VSBG-s37-1-q1 .

